      "writtenOn": "2023-08-16T06:53:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a bit mis-named, because in the case of probes these are questions, not replies; so here this is a packet count, but not a reply count.\n\nBut it\u0027s not a packet count either, because it is increased when addReplyFromService returns true, and there may be replies from 2 different services in a single packet.\n\nThe metric is called \"repliedRequestsCount\", so it sounds like it should not count probes or advertisements, since they are not replies to a request ? Maybe there should be different metrics for probes and advertisements ? Then this could really be \"repliedRequestsCount\" (only counting replies, possibly with different services having a reply in a single packet)\n\nCurrently the code counts probes, announcements, exit announcements as replies which seems strange.",
